  "prefLabel": "Lot 7202.18 Gross gaming revenue (GGR)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.18 “Gross gaming revenue (GGR)” means the total of all sums received by a game operator from operation of GOC, VLT, and HHR minus the total of all sums actually paid out as winnings to patrons, less any free play exempt under RSA 287-D:20, III that was paid to patrons.\n\nSource. #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7200.html"
}
